msgctxt "network_install_location_message"
msgid ""
"WinZapp is in a network folder and can't run from it:\n"
"\n"
"{path}\n"
"\n"
"This happens, for example, in virtual machines such as Parallels on a Mac, where the Downloads folder is actually a folder on the other computer. Install WinZapp with WinZappInstaller, or move the WinZapp folder to a drive on this computer, such as C:\\WinZapp, and open it from there.\n"
"\n"
"WinZapp will close now."
msgstr ""
"WinZapp está en una carpeta de red y no puede funcionar desde ella:\n"
"\n"
"{path}\n"
"\n"
"Esto ocurre, por ejemplo, en máquinas virtuales como Parallels en un Mac, donde la carpeta Descargas es en realidad una carpeta del otro ordenador. Instala WinZapp con WinZappInstaller, o mueve la carpeta de WinZapp a un disco de este ordenador, como C:\\WinZapp, y ábrelo desde allí.\n"
"\n"
"WinZapp se cerrará ahora."

#: translations/en-US/LC_MESSAGES/winzapp.po
#: client/main_window/settings.py:385
msgctxt "network_install_location_title"
msgid "WinZapp can't run from this folder"
msgstr "WinZapp no puede funcionar desde esta carpeta"

